Each completed run writes brainpong/brainpong_next_state.json. Its
next_start_level is the value to enter as --start-level for the next NF run in
the same mode chain. Points reset to init_points for each NF run.
Velocity and position modes start separate level chains.

The PsychoPy window waits for the scanner trigger key 's'.
Press ESC to end the Brain-pong presentation early.



